        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"Craig\"]\n\n<b>Silverleaf wrote:</b>\n<div class=\"bb-quote\"><blockquote class=\"bb-quote-body\">Strangely, I actually know where Corpus Christi is. I know nothing more about it, however.This may or may not be related to the fact that I will be in Dallas for BGGCon in November, if all things go well.</blockquote></div>\nOh, really? There are potentially going to be a couple of us there, too. No promises, though. \n[/quote]\n \n\nWe&#39;re working out the logistics but I have a con pass and a bed so far. ;) A BGG member set up a &quot;scholarship&quot; for a small number of women who can&#39;t afford to go to BGGCon and I applied and got one of the places. Yay!\n\nIt would be awesome to meet anyone who&#39;s around. :)\n",
